      "description": "She's the miserly old hag who runs the dock of Stormalong Harbor. The Dock Hag has an almost mystical flair for issuing tickets. And her favorite ticket is for leaving whales in the water unattended. Abhorrent Admirer: To K'nuckles, as we learn in on episode, and she even has a doll made of him out of parking tickets Evil Debt Collector: She has a unique talent for issuing tickets for various unusual reasons like laughing, arguing or dragging your feet. Fat Bitch: She is an overweight woman with an unpleasant attitude who's constantly handing out dock tickets and at one point outright calls Flapjack (a child) ugly. Gonk: Her face has been generously offered for a good number of the show's more disturbing closeups. It helps that her expression during these moments is either mindless fury or in one case depraved lust.",
